e to have your friends on the same sofa, heck, we haven’t been on the same sofa in months. Luckily Have a Blast works really well with Remote Play Together  and was extensively tested with it. It’s how we have been making this game for the last year.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STEAM DECK COMPATIBILITY</strong></h2>The game is 100% Steam Deck compatible.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WE HOPE YOU ENJOY OUR RETRO-INSPIRED MODERN-DESIGNED ARCADE!</strong></h2>", "short_description": "Have a Blast is a high energy, kinetic, multiplayer party game. Battle through the most ridiculously hazardous corners of the galaxy and use your surroundings to your advantage. Outmaneuver your frenemies and shatter them into colorful bits.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Portugal, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181650/header.jpg?t=1729252855", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181650/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1729252855", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1181650/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1729252855", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8 / 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 4.3+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirem